Mountain x3
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Eternal Flame
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Strip Mine
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain#1.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Strip Mine.Play
